=== .claude/skills/skill-curator/SKILL.md
---
name: skill-curator
description: Manage the skills in a Skillstation hub. Add, create, edit, check out, commit, pull, activate or retire a skill; add or fix its routing (triggers, examples, not-for); check or repair the hub. Not for using a skill in ordinary work.
---
<!-- Written by Skillstation (wrapper v1). Edit the skill in .agents/skills/skill-curator/, not here. -->

This skill lives in the shared Agent Skills folder. Read
`${CLAUDE_SKILL_DIR}/../../../.agents/skills/skill-curator/SKILL.md` now and follow it as this skill.
Wherever it mentions this skill's folder or its scripts, use
`${CLAUDE_SKILL_DIR}/../../../.agents/skills/skill-curator/`.
